## What was built (per ADR-016)

A shared, consent-gated, PII-redacting diagnostics module under `apps/shared/core/src/{common,android,apple}Main/.../diagnostics/`:

- **`Redaction`** ΓÇö central scrubber: deny-list keys (VIN, tokens, lat/lon, email, address, etc. ΓÇö snake_case + camelCase normalized) ΓåÆ `[REDACTED]`, plus value-pattern pass (JWT, Bearer, 17-char VIN, coord pairs, email, E.164) for defense-in-depth. Non-PII operational fields retained.
- **`Logger`** ΓÇö leveled, structured, scrubbed centrally (not per-call).
- **`Telemetry`** ΓÇö typed `TelemetryEvent` taxonomy (`screen_view`, `command_issued`, `error`); no free-form payloads.
- **`CrashReporter`** ΓÇö breadcrumbs + exceptions scrubbed before the sink.
- **`Diagnostics` + `DiagnosticsConsent`** ΓÇö default-OFF consent; all sinks no-op until granted; **revoke purges queued data**.
- **`DiagnosticsSink`** `expect`/`actual` with android (`Log`) + apple (`NSLog`) actuals over a shared `BufferedDiagnosticsSink` (P5/H7 binds Sentry at the same seam).

